graph TD
  accTitle: Simulation mission lifecycle, distinct approval and receipt stages
  accDescr: Received evidence leads to a proposal and a current-Chief approval check, then a locally enqueued command. Built pure functions validate this boundary and reduce receipt stages, but transport and executor runtime integration are not done. The intended runtime distinguishes sent, delivered, accepted, running and completed. Invalid or declined work stops without enqueueing. Delivery may be rejected. Frozen or replay mode does not dispatch; renewed scope requires fresh human approval, not silent retries.

  subgraph LOCAL["BUILT local state"]
    direction TB
    EVIDENCE["Received evidence"]
    PROPOSE["Proposal"]
    APPROVE["Current-Chief approval<br/>Scope · versions · expiry"]
    ENQUEUE["enqueued<br/>Reservation + command"]
    STOP["Stop: no enqueue<br/>Invalid / stale / declined"]
    EVIDENCE --> PROPOSE --> APPROVE
    APPROVE -->|eligible + approved| ENQUEUE
    APPROVE -->|invalid or no approval| STOP
  end

  subgraph RUNTIME["PLANNED runtime"]
    direction TB
    SENT["sent<br/>Intent transmitted"]
    DELIVERED["delivered<br/>Arrival receipt"]
    ACCEPTED["accepted<br/>Executor revalidates"]
    RUNNING["running<br/>Progress received"]
    COMPLETED["completed<br/>Terminal fact received"]
    REJECTED["failed / cancelled / rejected<br/>Separate terminal outcomes"]
    SENT --> DELIVERED --> ACCEPTED --> RUNNING --> COMPLETED
    DELIVERED -->|executor refuses| REJECTED
    RUNNING -->|failure or cancellation| REJECTED
  end

  HOLD["BUILT · frozen / replay guard<br/>No dispatch, no silent resume"]
  ENQUEUE -. future delivery adapter .-> SENT
  APPROVE -->|inactive / replay / offline| HOLD

  classDef built fill:#ffffff,stroke:#006bff,stroke-width:2px,color:#171717;
  classDef planned fill:#fafafa,stroke:#7d7d7d,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#171717;
  class EVIDENCE,PROPOSE,APPROVE,ENQUEUE,STOP,HOLD built;
  class SENT,DELIVERED,ACCEPTED,RUNNING,COMPLETED,REJECTED planned;
  style LOCAL fill:#fafafa,stroke:#006bff
  style RUNTIME fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c9c9c9,stroke-dasharray:6 4
